<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key>
	<string>zh_CN</string>
	<key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>
	<string>Aevis</string>
	<key>CFBundleExecutable</key>
	<string>$(EXECUTABLE_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundleIdentifier</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)</string>
	<key>CFBundleInfoDictionaryVersion</key>
	<string>6.0</string>
	<key>CFBundleName</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
	<string>APPL</string>
	<!-- 注册自己的 scheme。快捷指令最后加一步「打开 URL」填 aevis://...
	     就能把数据交回这个 App —— 这是快捷指令输出唯一能回来的路
	     （shortcuts://run-shortcut 是没有返回值的）。 -->
	<key>CFBundleURLTypes</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>CFBundleTypeRole</key>
			<string>Editor</string>
			<key>CFBundleURLName</key>
			<string>com.aevis.ios</string>
			<key>CFBundleURLSchemes</key>
			<array>
				<string>aevis</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
	</array>
	<key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
	<string>$(MARKETING_VERSION)</string>
	<key>CFBundleVersion</key>
	<string>$(CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION)</string>
	<key>AevisCommit</key>
	<string>$(AEVIS_COMMIT)</string>
	<key>LSRequiresIPhoneOS</key>
	<true/>
	<key>LSApplicationQueriesSchemes</key>
	<array>
		<string>shortcuts</string>
		<string>snssdk1128</string>
		<string>aweme</string>
		<string>weixin</string>
		<string>alipays</string>
		<string>taobao</string>
		<string>bilibili</string>
		<string>zhihu</string>
		<string>xiaohongshu</string>
		<string>music</string>
	</array>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Aevis 需要使用麦克风：你可以直接说话和 TA 聊天，也能和 TA 实时通话。</string>
	<key>NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Aevis 需要语音识别，把你的话转成文字发给 TA。识别尽量在本机完成。</string>
	<key>NSCalendarsFullAccessUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Aevis 需要读取和写入日历，这样 TA 才能告诉你接下来有什么安排、也能帮你把事记进日程。</string>
	<key>NSRemindersFullAccessUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Aevis 需要访问提醒事项，这样你让 TA「记一下」的时候才能真的记住。</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Aevis 需要知道你大概在哪，这样才能告诉你当地的天气、以及「离家多远」这类事。不会上传位置。</string>
	<key>NSHealthShareUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Aevis 需要读取你的步数、心率和睡眠，这样你问「今天走了多少」「昨晚睡得怎么样」时 TA 答得出来。数据不会离开这台手机。</string>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Aevis 需要使用相机，这样你可以拍一张照片，让 TA 把上面的字读出来。</string>
	<key>UIApplicationSupportsIndirectInputEvents</key>
	<true/>
	<key>UILaunchScreen</key>
	<dict/>
	<key>UIRequiredDeviceCapabilities</key>
	<array>
		<string>arm64</string>
	</array>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
	</array>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations~ipad</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortraitUpsideDown</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeLeft</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeRight</string>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
